<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wen-of-sui" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/emperor-wen-of-sui.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/march-4">4 March</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Yang Jian proclaims himself Emperor Wen of Sui</h3><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wen-of-sui">Yang Jian</a>, an official of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/northern-zhou">Northern Zhou</a>, seized power and founded the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sui-dynasty">Sui dynasty</a> as Emperor Wen. In 589 he conquered the southern Chen dynasty, reuniting <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a> after nearly three centuries of division.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wen-of-sui">Emperor Wen of Sui</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sui-dynasty">Sui dynasty</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/northern-zhou">Northern Zhou</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
